  "title": "Speeding up this bitcoin payment sent it to a thief #shorts",
  "description": "The Electrum bitcoin wallet patched a flaw (fixed in version 4.8.3) that let rogue servers show a fake pending payment, so raising the fee signed a real payment to the attacker; at least one user lost funds. Keep your wallet updated and check the full address before you sign anything, even a fee bump.\n\nEducational content, not financial advice.\n\n#crypto #bitcoin #cryptoscam #shorts",
